tags.description:
Webhooks are server callbacks to your server from Gallabox Server. Webhooks are event-based and are sent when specific events related to the Contacts, Messages happen.

Gallabox sends the following payloads for Contacts and Messages events:

### Contact Webhooks Events:

- `Contact.Created`

- `Contact.Updated`

- `Contact.Tag.Mapped`

- `Contact.Tag.Unmapped`


